# DEPRECATED — the app no longer reads a .env file.
#
# Supabase config is now baked in at compile time via --dart-define-from-file.
# Use dart_define.example.json in this directory instead:
#
#     cp dart_define.example.json dart_define.json    # then fill in the values
#     flutter run --dart-define-from-file=dart_define.json -d chrome
#
# See mobile/README.md → Quick Start.
#
# Stripe secrets and the service_role key are NOT client config — they live in
# Supabase Edge Function secrets. See brain/stripe_setup.md.
